  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.10": "on one, it\u0027s time to cast! ",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.11": "  Keep your eyes on the",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.12": "bobber and patiently wait",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.13": "for your time to strike.",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.5": "  If you wish to catch more",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.6": "than measly salmon or cod",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.7": "you\u0027ll  first need a",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.8": "\u003cgradient-67\u003eStarcatcher\u0027s rod\u003c/gradient-90\u003e!",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.left.9": "  Once you get your hands",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.10": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.11": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.12": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.13": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.14": "  Not every fish will fight",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.15": "the same way so be ready",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.16": "for anything! Especially",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.17": "those \u003crgb\u003elegendary\u003c/rgb\u003e fish that",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.18": "you might have heard about!",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.3": "  These fish won\u0027t give in so",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.4": "easily, make sure to hit all",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.5": "their sweetspots until you",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.6": "reel them in!",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.7": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.8": "",
  "gui.guide.page.basics.right.9": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.10": "fun gadgets in the discord!",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.5": "  Gadgets are handy tools",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.6": "which might help you",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.7": "find new fish, display",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.8": "your catches and more!",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.left.9": "[WIP] please suggest",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.10": "even new armor or hats!",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.11": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.12": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.13": "  Some equipment might also",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.14": "be awarded as trophies, and",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.15": "provide modifiers much like",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.16": "hooks, bobbers \u0026 baits",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.5": "  Whilst looking for loot",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.6": "inside treasures you",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.7": "might come across some",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.8": "old smithing templates,",
  "gui.guide.page.cosmetics.right.9": "forgotten rods, and",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.10": "to open the rod\u0027s menu.",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.5": "  Hooks \u0026 Bobbers provide",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.6": "different modifiers to aid",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.7": "catching even the most",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.8": "challenging fish!",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.left.9": "Use crouch + right click",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.10": "whilst using the correct bait.",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.5": "  Baits usually lure fish",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.6": "faster, but may also contain",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.7": "modifiers!",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.8": "",
  "gui.guide.page.hooks.right.9": "  Some fish might only bite",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.10": "sweetspots will make your",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.11": "fishing journey much easier.",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.12": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.13": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.5": "  Different fishes will",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.6": "fight differently when",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.7": "being reeled in!",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.8": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.left.9": "  Knowing all the different",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.10": "    gone once they vanish.",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.11": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.12": "    Stone sweetspots barely",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.13": "    award any progress.",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.14": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.15": "    Gold sweetspots award",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.16": "    treasure progress.",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.17": "And many more!",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.3": "    The basic sweetspot.",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.4": "    Not much else to it.",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.5": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.6": "    A frozen Sweetspot.",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.7": "    Best to avoid it.",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.8": "",
  "gui.guide.page.sweetspots.right.9": "    Aqua sweetspots are",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.10": "  Much like other templates,",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.11": "simply put them together",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.12": "with your rod in a",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.13": "Smithing Table!",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.5": "  Templates allow you to",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.6": "customize different parts",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.7": "of your rod, such as the",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.8": "bobber, visuals and sounds!",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.left.9": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.right.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.right.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.right.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.right.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.right.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.right.5": "  On top of looking",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.right.6": "fashionable, equipment might",
  "gui.guide.page.templates.right.7": "offer modifiers to aid you.",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.10": "You\u0027ve found a \u003cgradient-08\u003etreasure\u003c/gradient-15\u003e!",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.5": "  Whilst fishing for one of",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.6": "the harder fishes you",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.7": "might feel something extra ",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.8": "pulling your hook down!",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.left.9": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.10": "stronger loot! Be ready for",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.11": "a hard fight if you wish to",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.12": "catch the best treasures.",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.13": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.14": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.15": "  Treasures are the best",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.16": "way to find cosmetics for",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.17": "your rods!",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.4": "  But do you have the skill",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.5": "to catch it without letting",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.6": "the fish swim away?",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.7": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.8": "",
  "gui.guide.page.treasure.right.9": "  Stronger fishes might hide",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.5": "  Trophies are a display",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.6": "of one\u0027s skill in angling",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.7": "and are sure to put",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.8": "others to shame for their",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.left.9": "lack of trophyfulness.",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.5": "  Who knows what forgotten",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.6": "stories you might find",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.7": "encapsulated in bottles",
  "gui.guide.page.trophies.right.8": "adrift the waves.",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.10": "  Dangerous fluids such as",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.11": "lava will require a",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.12": "\u003crgb\u003eNetherite Upgraded\u003c/rgb\u003e rod!",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.13": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.14": "  Much like armor or tools,",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.15": "you may upgrade your rod",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.16": "in a Smithing Table with",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.17": "a Netherite Template.",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.5": "  If you wish to catch",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.6": "every single fish you\u0027ll",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.7": "have to cast into more than",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.8": "just water.",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.left.9": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.0": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.1": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.10": "in Hooks, Bobbers, and baits,",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.11": "but several other items",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.12": "may also provide them.",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.13": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.14": "  Choosing the correct",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.15": "modifiers may make all the",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.16": "difference between catching",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.17": "a fish or letting it escape!",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.2": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.3": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.4": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.5": "  As you experiment with",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.6": "different items, you\u0027ll find",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.7": "some may contain \u003crgb\u003eModifiers\u003c/rgb\u003e.",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.8": "",
  "gui.guide.page.upgrades.right.9": "  You\u0027ll first encounter them",
  "gui.guide.sort": "[sort]",
  "gui.guide.sweetspots": "  Sweetspots",
  "gui.guide.templates": "    Templates",
